  {
    "statement": "Sowing native grass and forb seeds is the most frequently studied and effective method for establishing native forbs in degraded grasslands.",
    "citations": [
      "3432"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Fifty studies found that sowing native grass and forb seeds increased forb species richness in 71% of cases.",
